      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STILL SHADY (2) goes very well this trip starting six times for two wins and three minors. Missed the frame latest (30.49) when fifth over 520m at this track in a Grade 5. Looks the one to beat with even luck. MELLCAT ABBY (8) settled close to the lead but checked in the run and turned spotting a start, missing the frame when fifth (20.29) at Goulburn over 350m in a Grade 5. Solid beginner and with a good start should have clear running out wide. Rates a key player and gets chance to atone. SCOTT ENIGMA (1) is having her first look at this course. Comes here after a last start 4th and beaten 2.25 lengths (19.53) at Bulli. Safe beginner who draws ideally on the inside. Key runner who gets her chance to atone. SKEDADDLE PERCY (5) looks a top-three chance while fresh.",
